  "description": "Watch now | Why the biggest gains may still be ahead and why I'm already preparing for the exit.",
  "body_html": "<p>Do not let this video scare you…more so, put it in the back of your mind. Every element of a blow off top, that we have been talking about the past year+, is actively occurring:</p><ul><li><p>Mass liquidation events, such as Leopold Aschenbrenner. </p></li><li><p>Smaller countries indexes collapsing, most recently South Korea and Vietnam.</p></li><li><p>Now, drastic volatility swings in our own blue chip stocks (as shown in this video)</p></li></ul><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>I can't guarantee this is how it plays out, but enough pieces are falling into place that I'm preparing as though it will.<em><strong> </strong></em>So many retail and large speculators have moved into short positions…and I think the odds are incredibly likely that they will be squeezed to oblivion. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xbV0!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff3f24c53-b7a9-4780-b9f9-fe15dea5b7e2_1074x421.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xbV0!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff3f24c53-b7a9-4780-b9f9-fe15dea5b7e2_1074x421.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xbV0!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff3f24c53-b7a9-4780-b9f9-fe15dea5b7e2_1074x421.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xbV0!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff3f24c53-b7a9-4780-b9f9-fe15dea5b7e2_1074x421.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xbV0!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff3f24c53-b7a9-4780-b9f9-fe15dea5b7e2_1074x421.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xbV0!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff3f24c53-b7a9-4780-b9f9-fe15dea5b7e2_1074x421.png\" width=\"1074\" height=\"421\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/f3f24c53-b7a9-4780-b9f9-fe15dea5b7e2_1074x421.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:421,&quot;width&quot;:1074,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:41040,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/209396483?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff3f24c53-b7a9-4780-b9f9-fe15dea5b7e2_1074x421.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xbV0!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff3f24c53-b7a9-4780-b9f9-fe15dea5b7e2_1074x421.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xbV0!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff3f24c53-b7a9-4780-b9f9-fe15dea5b7e2_1074x421.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xbV0!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff3f24c53-b7a9-4780-b9f9-fe15dea5b7e2_1074x421.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xbV0!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff3f24c53-b7a9-4780-b9f9-fe15dea5b7e2_1074x421.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Save this video and this post, because when we get into healthy profits: </p><h4>DO NOT BE SURPRISED WHEN I, <em><strong>UNEXPECTEDLY</strong></em>, COME ON HERE AND TELL YOU I AM SELLING. </h4><p>If you have been watching the daily updates, none of this should be a shock to you. </p><p>Should my macro predictions for the markets continue to hold true, there will be <strong>euphoria and huge egos</strong>. Arrogant kids with tons of unrealized profits. They will lose it all, trying to time that top. Lets not be apart of Bagholders Club. </p><p>The <strong><a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/a27b2288-ae6c-4cb6-833a-bfb84d676813\">Quick Notes</a> </strong>is where my first sell off signals will be at. </p><p>Everything looks fine for now…just getting all you mentally prepared for this day now. </p><p>Have a great weekend and go touch some grass! </p><p><strong>Side note: </strong>If you like Spider-Man, the new movie “Brand New Day” was excellent, highly recommend. </p><p>I will see you all on Monday, if you have questions, just tag me in the main chat. </p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r3SF!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F545d5c5a-3f40-44b0-b1a1-980901ed236d_565x565.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div><p></p>",
